
# Local credentials must never enter a build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/secrets/
**/certs/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.token
**/*.secret
**/*.bin
**/firebase*-service-account*.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/baotin-ci.properties
**/.git/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/hs_err_pid*
**/replay_pid*
**/.verification/
**/.changes/
